# assetutilities is a sibling-repo dependency, not a git submodule.
# Development: clone vamseeachanta/assetutilities alongside this repo;
# [tool.uv.sources] in pyproject.toml resolves it as an editable path.
# CI: --no-sources disables that path; the gates in .claude/quality-gates.yaml
# overlay assetutilities from git main until a release >=0.1.1 is on PyPI.
